 gap +0.427 in the same direction as the team gap; most star cells are below the n>=30 gate.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 38/94 players at n>=15; only 3 at n>=30 both tiers\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-010", "score": 0.11, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-010 | Study family SF-APPS-010: Play-type PPP change across playoff series game buckets\n- observed_research_question: Play-type PPP change across playoff series game buckets\n- auto_outcome_status: inconclusive\n- observed_hypothesis: Play-type PPP (especially DRIVE) declines as a playoff series progresses, so DRIVE is a good early-series call.\n- observed_result: DRIVE 0.889 -> 0.949 (+0.060); CUT +0.114; PNR +0.087; PULL_UP -0.077; POST_UP -0.032.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:selection_or_regression_to_the_mean\n- observed_failure_evidence: 'NO CLEAR SIGNAL - DRIVE PPP is stable or improves across the series'; observational with selection caveats.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 1197 records; no CIs\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Pooled (series, team, PT, bucket) records (1197), EARLY G1-2 / MID G3-4 / LATE G5-7, min 10 poss, min 3 series.\n- observed_verdict: null\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-015", "score": 0.107, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-015 | Study family SF-APPS-015: Player BEST/AVOID tier tendency in H2 trigger games (55 series)\n- observed_research_question: Player BEST/AVOID tier tendency in H2 trigger games (55 series)\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Teams and players differ in how often H2 trigger possessions land on the engine's BEST vs AVOID counter.\n- observed_result: Team AVOID% ranges 50.6% (ORL) to 6.8% (SAC); team BEST% 0.0%-15.8%.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: No outcome test; player samples 10-178 possessions.\n- observed_sample_and_power: min 10 poss per player\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-048\n- observed_method: trigger_table_clean.csv, 55 series 2022-2026, 179 players, 25 teams, min 10 poss.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-001"}], "n_results": 4}

